{
  "sheet": "stats",
  "about": "Base and per-level stats written to each hero's CharacterBody. RoR2 itself applies level scaling in CharacterBody.RecalculateStats (stat = base + level * (level-1) ... i.e. base + levelX * (level - 1)), so filling the level* columns is what makes the heroes grow on level-up exactly like vanilla survivors. Values are anchored on the named RoR2 analog survivor (checked in game by the plugin's test mode against the analog's prefab) and nudged by the Deadlock hero's identity: Deadlock base HP Haze 730 / Seven 730 / Infernus 830 / Abrams 800 (+ the biggest per-boon growth), move speed Haze 8.2 is the fastest of the four.",
